infinite-patch 1
# West Coast Buchla Krell Pendulum Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 53
  i note1 53
  i note2 57
  i note3 60
  i note4 53
  i note5 55
  i note6 63
  i note7 60
  i note8 53
  i note9 53
  i note10 57
  i note11 59
  i note12 53
  i note13 65
  i note14 60
  i note15 53
  b en0 1
  b en1 1
  b en2 1
  b en3 1
  b en4 1
  b en5 1
  b en6 1
  b en7 1
  b en8 1
  b en9 1
  b en10 1
  b en11 1
